    Class Used: BankAccount
    Methods:
        __init__(self, owner, balance=0.0) → initializes account holder and balance.
    deposit(self, amount) → adds money to the account (only if positive).
    withdraw(self, amount) → deducts money, raises error on insufficient balance.
    display(self) → shows account holder and current balance.
    Demonstrates OOP concepts: classes, objects, instance variables, and methods.
    Supports multiple accounts using lists and loops.
    Includes exception handling for overdraw protection.
    Simulates a basic banking system with deposit and withdrawal operations.